#### Step 2.3: Implement Message Processing Logic

```csharp
using MediatR;

private readonly IMediator _mediator;

private async Task ProcessMessage(
    ConsumeResult<string, string> result,
    CancellationToken cancellationToken)
{
    // Deserialize message (Avro schema validation happens here)
    var messageEvent = DeserializeMessage(result.Message.Value);

    // Check for duplicate (idempotent processing)
    if (await IsDuplicate(messageEvent.EventId))
    {
        _logger.LogInformation(
            "Skipping duplicate message: EventId={EventId}",
            messageEvent.EventId);
        return;
    }

    // Publish to MediatR handlers
    await _mediator.Publish(messageEvent, cancellationToken);

    // Mark as processed
    await MarkAsProcessed(messageEvent.EventId);
}
```

